MODEL WEIGHTS: RESEARCH AND EVALUATION ONLY

courtvision/server/static/nba-student.onnx (the NBA detector, main model v3), and
the research weights kept in this repository's git history under models/research/,
were trained on data that does not allow commercial use:

  * SportsMOT (Cui et al., ICCV 2023), CC BY-NC 4.0: non-commercial use only,
    with credit. https://github.com/MCG-NJU/SportsMOT
  * BARD and E-BARD-detection (Giudici et al.), CC BY 4.0, on NBA footage.
    https://github.com/GabrieleGiudic/BARD
    https://huggingface.co/datasets/GabrieleGiudici/E-BARD-detection
  * basketball-player-detection-2 (Roboflow Universe), CC BY 4.0, on NBA footage.
    https://universe.roboflow.com/sameer-prasad-koppolu/basketball-player-detection-2-othh3
  * NBA broadcast recordings.

You may use these weights for research and evaluation, crediting the datasets
above. Do not use them in a commercial product. To ship a model, train one on
footage you have the rights to (see docs/TRAINING.md, section 1). Sources, hashes
and details: models/research/README.md.

